解析以下JSON数据并提取关键信息：
{
  "user": {
    "id": 12345,
    "name": "张三",
    "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
    "profile": {
      "age": 28,
      "city": "北京",
      "interests": ["编程", "阅读", "旅游"]
    }
  }
}

解析以下复杂嵌套数据：
{
  "company": {
    "name": "科技公司",
    "departments": [
      {
        "name": "研发部",
        "employees": [
          {"id": 1, "name": "张三", "skills": ["Python", "Java"]},
          {"id": 2, "name": "李四", "skills": ["JavaScript", "React"]}
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "市场部",
        "employees": [
          {"id": 3, "name": "王五", "skills": ["营销", "数据分析"]}
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

将以下JSON转换为CSV和XML格式：
[
  {"name": "张三", "age": 28, "city": "北京"},
  {"name": "李四", "age": 32, "city": "上海"},
  {"name": "王五", "age": 25, "city": "深圳"}
]
